==Battleground==
*1 [[Red Slug]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*1 [[Red Slug]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Red Slug]] spawns after 70 seconds<sup>2,100f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Black Slug]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Red Slug]]s spawn, delay 50~60 seconds<sup>1,500f~1,800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The Red Sluggy can easily be countered with [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cat]] and [[Ninja Cat (Special Cat)|Ninja Cat]]. The Black Sluggy can be countered the exact same way, as it is barely stronger than the Red Sluggy.

